# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model weights
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GitHub rejects any single file over 100 MB on a normal push, and Git LFS's
# free tier provides only 1 GiB of storage — so autocitation-extractor.q4_k_m.gguf
# (2.2 GB) cannot be committed by either route.
#
# It does not need to be. Everything required to regenerate it already lives in
# this repo: Backend/finetune/ holds the Modelfile, the Colab training
# notebook, build_dataset.py, and data/ (2.7 MB of train/val JSONL). Publish the
# built weights on Hugging Face Hub and link them from the README instead —
# weights are a build artefact, the recipe is the source.
*.gguf
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets and local configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editors and OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Deliberately NOT ignored
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Backend/regression_baseline.json — timings vary by machine, but the recorded
#   LABELS are the point of the file: diffing them is how a prompt change that
#   silently breaks a verdict gets caught.
# Backend/finetune/data/*.jsonl — 2.7 MB total, well under any limit, and the
#   training set is what makes the fine-tune reproducible.
